t0c ZINC : DOCUMENTATION [0.1.0]

lc THIS DOCUMENT DESCRIBES ALL THE PROCESSES OF ZINC.

b
pc In this document, you will find all the information about ZINC. \
However, this does NOT include any documentation about the Z \
programming language or related libraries.

pc If you want to get some information about a specific function or \
type or whatsoever concerns a Z library, you may take a look at STDZ \
(the default Z standard library) :
lc \l\lhttps://zlang.org/stdz\l
b

pc \bPLEASE READ CAREFULLY ALL OF THE SECTIONS OF THIS DOCUMENTATION \
BEFORE REPORTING ANYTHING.\b

